    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/472809c833d68810af661562d5d6ab1f.poster.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/472809c833d68810af661562d5d6ab1f.webm?t=1748555900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/472809c833d68810af661562d5d6ab1f.mp4?t=1748555900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Off the Shelf!</i> is a hilarious physics-based romp made for maximum chaos! Launch a free ragdoll character into a frantic rush, knocking objects off shelves to rack up points. Master the art of Shelf Surfing as you jump, dash, and smash your way to a high score! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/f1aeba89073faa34bd971feccee25699.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/3e36d7cfb6ef9b03357caa51eba16d28.webp?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch headfirst into physics-driven chaos! Experience wild slapstick gameplay as you propel your ragdoll through aisles packed with destructible delights. Control every spin, jump, and dive with precision, animating your character entirely through your own chaotic maneuvers. Feel the thrill of intense speed, massive air, and hilarious collisions, that make every wipeout a unique work of art. Anyone can become a master Shelf Surfer - as long as they're willing to break a few eggs first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/e833b135f6c30561ed0cf2287fdf9efb.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/ca0d11b049741aab5d595fa59f6e49d0.webp?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack up points by slamming through objects at breakneck speeds - the harder your collisions, the bigger your score! With 100+ unique items filling the shelves, you won't be running out of stuff to wreck anytime soon. Push your skills to  unlock 12 quirky skins, 4 thrilling levels, and hidden rewards full of surprises. Do you have the spine, speed, and spirit to become the greatest Shelf Surfer of all time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/c6e69762d52bc03b6fcdf59816165a07.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/3af7ed2f123344200545950dcc93b21c.webp?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to realtime physics, procedurally stocked levels, and a buttery smooth gameplay loop, <i>Off the Shelf!</i> will keep you coming back for just one more run - whether you have five hours, or five minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's something for everyone, with multiple game modes to match your mood and playstyle. For a relaxed experience, Endless Mode lets you wreck infinite aisles at your own pace, perfecting your Shelf Surfing skills without the pressure of a score. For those who wish to truly test their Shelf Surfing mettle, Challenge Mode awaits, daring you to master tricky feats to unlock rewards. Or just stick with Arcade mode to try and top your high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you there, Shelf Surfers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/3b430342cbde1b2acefe8f92ba335bed.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/472809c833d68810af661562d5d6ab1f.poster.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/472809c833d68810af661562d5d6ab1f.webm?t=1748555900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/472809c833d68810af661562d5d6ab1f.mp4?t=1748555900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Off the Shelf!</i> is a hilarious physics-based romp made for maximum chaos! Launch a free ragdoll character into a frantic rush, knocking objects off shelves to rack up points. Master the art of Shelf Surfing as you jump, dash, and smash your way to a high score! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/f1aeba89073faa34bd971feccee25699.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/3e36d7cfb6ef9b03357caa51eba16d28.webp?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch headfirst into physics-driven chaos! Experience wild slapstick gameplay as you propel your ragdoll through aisles packed with destructible delights. Control every spin, jump, and dive with precision, animating your character entirely through your own chaotic maneuvers. Feel the thrill of intense speed, massive air, and hilarious collisions, that make every wipeout a unique work of art. Anyone can become a master Shelf Surfer - as long as they're willing to break a few eggs first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/e833b135f6c30561ed0cf2287fdf9efb.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/ca0d11b049741aab5d595fa59f6e49d0.webp?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack up points by slamming through objects at breakneck speeds - the harder your collisions, the bigger your score! With 100+ unique items filling the shelves, you won't be running out of stuff to wreck anytime soon. Push your skills to  unlock 12 quirky skins, 4 thrilling levels, and hidden rewards full of surprises. Do you have the spine, speed, and spirit to become the greatest Shelf Surfer of all time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/c6e69762d52bc03b6fcdf59816165a07.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/3af7ed2f123344200545950dcc93b21c.webp?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to realtime physics, procedurally stocked levels, and a buttery smooth gameplay loop, <i>Off the Shelf!</i> will keep you coming back for just one more run - whether you have five hours, or five minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's something for everyone, with multiple game modes to match your mood and playstyle. For a relaxed experience, Endless Mode lets you wreck infinite aisles at your own pace, perfecting your Shelf Surfing skills without the pressure of a score. For those who wish to truly test their Shelf Surfing mettle, Challenge Mode awaits, daring you to master tricky feats to unlock rewards. Or just stick with Arcade mode to try and top your high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you there, Shelf Surfers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584250/extras/3b430342cbde1b2acefe8f92ba335bed.avif?t=1748555900\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
